{"claims":[{"claim_text":"DSA's resolution builds on the electoral standards of the Anti-Zionist Resolution introduced by Ahmed H. and passed by the 2023-2025 National Political Committee and over 56 DSA chapters, continuing to provide a material counterweight to the Zionist lobby.","claim_types":["policy_position"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"DSA's resolution expands uptake of the Stop Fueling Genocide, No Appetite for Apartheid, and Mask Off Maersk campaigns.","claim_types":["policy_position"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"DSA's resolution establishes an Arms Embargo Steering Committee to increase coordination across labor, legislative, and community organizing efforts to disrupt the flow of weapons to Israel.","claim_types":["policy_position"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"DSA's resolution supports chapters in pursuing divestment through pressure campaigns and ballot initiatives.","claim_types":["policy_position"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"DSA's resolution develops strategies to protect the movement and build resilience against state repression.","claim_types":["policy_position"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"DSA prioritizes a grassroots approach to resisting fascism and presents three strategic points of activation: making immigrant defense an organizational priority through a national Abolish ICE campaign, supporting chapters in building local and state-level campaigns around abolitionist demands, and scaling up DSA's ability to fight state repression by strengthening Red Rabbits and building infrastructure to support comrades facing repression.","claim_types":["policy_position"],"evidence_ids":[2]},{"claim_text":"DSA makes it a priority to take incremental steps to explore building a broad Left-Labor electoral coalition capable of organizing the foundation of independence from the duopoly.","claim_types":["policy_position"],"evidence_ids":[4]},{"claim_text":"DSA directs DSA to convene a 2028 Planning Committee to explore the viability of different organizing strategies, liaise across national bodies, and build local chapter preparedness in preparation for 2028.","claim_types":["policy_position"],"evidence_ids":[4]}],"unresolved_references":[]}
```

